=== sg_dd ===
USAGE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  sg_dd [bs=BS] [conv=CONV] [count=COUNT] [ibs=BS] [if=IFILE] [iflag=FLAGS]
      [obs=BS] [of=OFILE] [oflag=FLAGS] [seek=SEEK] [skip=SKIP] [--dry-run]
      [--help] [--verbose] [--version]


FLAGS (6) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    --dry-run   do preparation but bypass copy (or read)
-h, --help      print out this usage message then exit
-p, --progress  print progress report every 2 minutes
-v, --verbose   same as 'verbose=1', can be used multiple times
-x, --verify    do verify/compare rather than copy (OFILE must be a sg
                device)
-V, --version   print version information then exit
